            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "HealthyBatch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very tasty way to make Parsnips. My husband picked some up from a local market and we weren't quite sure what to do with them. Instead of the 1/2 cup of butter I used some olive oil mixed with a bit of garlic butter and that worked great! Very yummy and the hubby loved it.",
